# Security basics

- Parameterized SQL only; no string-built queries.
- Never log bot tokens, API keys, raw initData, or voice bytes.
- Validate Telegram Mini App initData on the server for privileged routes; `?uid=` is smoke-only.
- Do not fetch customer-supplied URLs server-side without allowlisting (SSRF).
- Escape customer/TZ text in HTML; no `innerHTML` of untrusted strings.
- Uploads stay under `UPLOAD_DIR`; no user path segments.
- Full checklist: `.cursor/skills/security-review/SKILL.md`.
